<section class="section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:860px">
    <div class="small-caps mb-2"><%= t('About Quranic') %></div>
    <h1 class="mb-4"><%= t('Serving the people of the Quran with better tools') %></h1>
    <p class="lead text-muted"><%= t('Quranic is a cloud platform built specifically for Quran schools, dugsi and madrasas. It replaces paper registers, scattered spreadsheets and handwritten receipts with one organised, secure system.') %></p>
    <div class="row g-3 my-4">
      <div class="col-md-4"><div class="feature-tile"><div class="stat-icon emerald"><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i></div><h3 class="h6"><%= t('Private by design') %></h3><p class="small text-muted mb-0"><%= t("Every school's data is isolated. Platform staff see usage totals — not your students or finances.") %></p></div></div>
      <div class="col-md-4"><div class="feature-tile"><div class="stat-icon gold"><i class="bi bi-calculator"></i></div><h3 class="h6"><%= t('Accurate accounts') %></h3><p class="small text-muted mb-0"><%= t('Money is stored in exact cents, payments are never deleted, and every reversal is audited.') %></p></div></div>
      <div class="col-md-4"><div class="feature-tile"><div class="stat-icon blue"><i class="bi bi-phone"></i></div><h3 class="h6"><%= t('Works everywhere') %></h3><p class="small text-muted mb-0"><%= t('Responsive on phones, tablets and desktops — take attendance from the classroom.') %></p></div></div>
    </div>
    <h2 class="h4 mt-5"><%= t('Our mission') %></h2>
    <p><%= t("Teachers of the Quran should spend their time teaching — not chasing paperwork. Quranic gives administrators clear numbers, gives teachers simple tools to record Hifz and Muraja'ah, and gives parents trustworthy receipts.") %></p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary mt-2" href="/register"><%= t('Register your school') %></a>
  </div>
</section>
